Abstract:

Theoretical sessions:
A) The methodology of process synthesis, reactions and separation systems synthesis;
B) Energetic integration;
C) Usage of simulators for process design;
D) Pre-sizing of equipment and cost estimation;
E) Economic evaluation;
F) Evaluation of alternative processes and sensitivity analysis.
Working out a chemical process design, applying the knowledge mentioned above, with emphasis on the elaboration of conceptual process design using engineering as a creative tool.

